space structure on them, and we see the isomorphism A8 ∼= L4(2) again (see
Section 3.12.1).
The stabilizer of one of the Golay code words of weight 12 (a dodecad) is
a group of order |M24|/2576 = 95040, and is the group M 12. The fact that
M12 is a subgroup of M 24 was not known to Mathieu, and was ﬁrst discovered
